[I] Driver and GUI for LMS7002M-based SDR platforms

[T] Driver and GUI for LMS7002M-based SDR platforms

[U] https://github.com/myriadrf/LimeSuite

[A] myriadrf
[M] andrei32 <andrei32.t2@gmail.com>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS OBJDIR

[E] opt octave

[L] APL
[V] 23.11.0

[D] 1d61250df22055d23b1e6405058a6f0eee0a9fc88da41a09977e7568 LimeSuite-23.11.0.tar.gz https://github.com/myriadrf/LimeSuite/archive/v23.11.0/

var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' "-I$root$(pkgprefix includedir libx11) -L$root$(pkgprefix libdir libx11)"
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -std=gnu17

var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5
pkginstalled doxygen && var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DENABLE_API_DOXYGEN=ON
